WEBVTT

00:16:29.272 --> 00:16:32.332
his choice of translations
of different Bible verses.

00:16:32.999 --> 00:16:38.000
The book is clear, vivid, accessible,
beautifully formatted.

00:16:39.323 --> 00:16:40.976
Just enough repetition.

00:16:41.528 --> 00:16:42.814
That's really important.

00:16:43.568 --> 00:16:47.260
Every time you read it or say it,
you make another copy in your brain.

00:16:48.871 --> 00:16:52.616
Every time you read it or say it,
you make another copy in your brain.

00:16:52.640 --> 00:16:53.648
(Laughter)

00:16:53.672 --> 00:16:54.916
With me, everybody --

00:16:54.940 --> 00:16:57.916
(Audience and Dan Dennett)
Every time you read it or say it,

00:16:57.940 --> 00:17:00.241
you make another copy in your brain.